<doc id="99283" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=99283" title="Radio France Internationale">
Radio France Internationale

Radio France Internationale (RFI) dipundhirikaken taun &lt;a href="1975"&gt;1975&lt;/a&gt; minangka péranganing &lt;a href="Radio%20France"&gt;Radio France&lt;/a&gt; déning Pamarèntah &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt; kanggé nglayani minangka wahana giyaran kanggé &lt;a href="Afrika%20Khatulistiwa%20Perancis"&gt;Afrika Khatulistiwa Perancis&lt;/a&gt;. Taun &lt;a href="1986"&gt;1986&lt;/a&gt; sawijining hukum énggal dipunsahaken déning Parlemèn Perancis ingkang ngidinaken RFI nindakaken operasi kanthi indepènden saking Radio France.
RFI nindakaken operasi wonten ing sangandhaping pambiyantu saking &lt;a href="Mantri%20Luar%20Negeri%20%28Perancis%29"&gt;Mantri Luar Negeri Perancis&lt;/a&gt;. Siaran dipunadani wonten ing manéka basa, kalebet &lt;a href="Basa%20Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Basa%20Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Basa%20Portugis"&gt;Portugis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Basa%20Rumania"&gt;Rumania&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Basa%20Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Basa%20Cina"&gt;Cina&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Basa%20Spanyol"&gt;Basa Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;.
Layanan RFI kanthi basa Inggris wonten udakawis gangsal setengah jam saben dintenipun. Pérangan musik situs webipun gadhah biografi wonten ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Perancis"&gt;Basa Perancis&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Basa%20Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;.
Tanggal &lt;a href="17"&gt;17&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="September"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;, bekas présidhèn &lt;a href="Togo"&gt;Togo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gnassingb%C3%A9%20Eyad%C3%A9ma"&gt;Gnassingbé Eyadéma&lt;/a&gt; ngupaya mandhegaken panyiaran wawancara kaliyan salah satunggaling pesaingipun, &lt;a href="Messan%20Agb%C3%A9yom%C3%A9%20Kodjo"&gt;Messan Agbéyomé Kodjo&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi nélpon langsung dhateng &lt;a href="Pura%20Elys%C3%A9e"&gt;Pura Elysée&lt;/a&gt;. Wawancara punika boten dipunsénsor déning &lt;a href="Jean-Paul%20Cluzel"&gt;Jean-Paul Cluzel&lt;/a&gt;, CEO RFI nalika samanten, amargi intervénsi persatuan perdagangan jurnalis. Nanging, pitakénan bab tanggel jawab agèn rahasia Perancis wonten ing sédanipun hakim wonten ing &lt;a href="Djibouti"&gt;Djibouti&lt;/a&gt;, ingkang sampundipunwartakaken tanggal &lt;a href="17"&gt;17&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="M%C3%A8i"&gt;Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, lajeng dipubisak déning situs web RFI kanggé alesan ingkang dèrèng dipunsami mangertosi, mbok manawi amargi intervèns présidhèn Djibouti &lt;a href="Ismail%20Omar%20Guelleh"&gt;Ismail Omar Guelleh&lt;/a&gt;.
Tanggal &lt;a href="21"&gt;21&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Oktober"&gt;Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jean%20H%C3%A9l%C3%A8ne"&gt;Jean Hélène&lt;/a&gt;nglapuraken kanggé RFI sadanguning perang sipil ing &lt;a href="Pasisir%20Gading"&gt;Pasisir Gading&lt;/a&gt; nalika piyambakipun séda wonten ing &lt;a href="Abidjan"&gt;Abidjan&lt;/a&gt; déning pulisi Sersan Théodore Séry Dago.
Presenter giyaran RFI kanthi basa Inggris sadèrèngipun inggih punika &lt;a href="Owen%20Thomas"&gt;Owen Thomas&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="CNN%20International"&gt;CNN International&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Siaran</h2>
Siaran.
Radio France Internationale ngudhara wonten ing basa Perancis, nanging ugi margi sajumlah giyaran kanthi basa-basa asin. Salah satunggalipun inggih punika basa Inggris, katujuokaken dhateng pamireng &lt;a href="Afrika%20Selatan"&gt;Afrika Selatan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kenya"&gt;Kenya&lt;/a&gt;, nanging kanthi program kanggé Timur Tengah lan Asia Selatan. RFI martakaken pawarta énjing, siyang, surup lan program ndalu:
0400-0430 UTC RFI News and Sport
0500-0530 UTC RFI News and Sport
0600-0630 UTC RFI News and Sport
0700-0730 UTC RFI News and Sport
0730-0800 UTC English language features programming
1200-1210 UTC RFI News
1210-1230 UTC English language features programming
1400-1430 UTC RFI News and Sport
1430-1500 UTC English language features programming
1600-1630 UTC RFI News and Sport
1630-1700 UTC English language features programming
1700-1730 UTC RFI News &amp; African features
Sedaya giyaran RFI kanthi basa Inggris kasamekta ing Internet lan kangg-dipunundhuh wonten ing situs web basa Inggris ing rfi.fr.
