<doc id="99297" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=99297" title="Métropole 6">
Métropole 6

Métropole 6 utawi langkung asring dipuntepangi minangka M6, inggih punika sawijining layanan &lt;a href="televisi"&gt;televisi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt; ingkang minangka kagunganipun parusahan Métropole Télévision. M6 nyiaraken sinyal &lt;a href="SECAM"&gt;SECAM&lt;/a&gt; ing-inggil-toya, lan ugi wonten ing satelit siar &lt;a href="Atlantic%20Bird%203"&gt;Atlantic Bird 3&lt;/a&gt;. M6 ugi nyiarkan sinyal digital dhateng &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt; lumantar satelit siar W3A. Taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, saluran punika dados layanan televisi pribadi ingkang kathah piyambak angka kalih ingkang dipunpirsani ing &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt;, sasampuning &lt;a href="TF1"&gt;TF1&lt;/a&gt;.
Saluran TV sanès ing portofolio M6 ngambah saluran terrestrial digital &lt;a href="W9%20%28televisi%29"&gt;W9&lt;/a&gt; lan saluran kabel digital &lt;a href="M6%20Music"&gt;M6 Music Hits&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="M6%20Music%20Black"&gt;M6 Music Black&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="M6%20Music%20Rock"&gt;M6 Music Rock&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Fun%20TV"&gt;Fun TV&lt;/a&gt;.
M6 dipunluncuraken tanggal &lt;a href="1"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1987"&gt;1987&lt;/a&gt; jam 11:15 énjing. CET nggantosaken &lt;a href="TV6%20France"&gt;TV6&lt;/a&gt;.
Rai on-air M6 nedahaken bilih layananipun katujokaken dhateng para remaja lan remaja diwasa. Program pada jadwalnya terdiri dari:
<ul>
<li>Acara TV &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Desperate%20Housewives"&gt;Desperate Housewives&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="NCIS%20%28serial%20TV%29"&gt;NCIS&lt;/a&gt; (NCIS: enquêtes spéciales) ; &lt;a href="Prison%20Break"&gt;Prison Break&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="Medium%20%28serial%20TV%29"&gt;Medium&lt;/a&gt; (Médium) ; &lt;a href="My%20Name%20Is%20Earl"&gt;My Name Is Earl&lt;/a&gt; (Earl) ; &lt;a href="NUMB3RS"&gt;NUMB3RS&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="Bones%20%28serial%20TV%29"&gt;Bones&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="Scrubs%20%28serial%20TV%29"&gt;Scrubs&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="The%20Unit"&gt;The Unit&lt;/a&gt; (The Unit: commando d'élite) ; &lt;a href="Stargate%20Atlantis"&gt;Stargate Atlantis&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="Nip/Tuck"&gt;Nip/Tuck&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="Californication%20%28TV%20series%29"&gt;Californication&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="Kyle%20XY"&gt;Kyle XY&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="Everybody%20Hates%20Chris"&gt;Everybody Hates Chris&lt;/a&gt; (Tout le monde déteste Chris) ; &lt;a href="Supernatural%20%28serial%20TV%29"&gt;Supernatural&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Smallville%20%28serial%20TV%29"&gt;Smallville&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Program Amérika: &lt;a href="High%20School%20Musical"&gt;High School Musical&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="America%27s%20Got%20Talent"&gt;America's Got Talent&lt;/a&gt; (Incroyable Talent).</li>
<li>Acara TV &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Primeval%20%28serial%20TV%29"&gt;Primeval&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Acara TV Britania berikut disiarkan di M6: &lt;a href="Footballers%27%20Wives"&gt;Footballers' Wives&lt;/a&gt; (Femme$ de footballeurs) ; &lt;a href="Queer%20as%20Folk%20%28serial%20TV%20Britania%20Raya%29"&gt;Queer as Folk&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="Totally%20Frank"&gt;Totally Frank&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="Bugs%20%28serial%20TV%29"&gt;Bugs&lt;/a&gt; ; lan &lt;a href="Hex%20%28serial%20TV%29"&gt;Hex&lt;/a&gt; (Hex: la malédiction).</li>
<li>Acara jurnalisme investigasi, kados Capital, Zone interdite lan Enquête Exclusive.</li>
<li>Program cekak ingkang dangu operasi, kados Turbo, CinéSix, dan E=M6, lan &lt;a href="video%20musik"&gt;video musik&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
Taun 2001, M6 dados saluran televisi Perancis kapisanan ingkang nyiarkan program realita. Program ing genre ingkang kapisanan inggih punika &lt;a href="Loft%20Story%20%28Perancis%29"&gt;Loft Story&lt;/a&gt;, lan asring dipuntonton. Présidhèn TF1 nalika punika, Étienne Mougeotte, janji bilih TF1 boten badhé nyiarkan program realita napa-napa. Nanging, sapérangan taun candhakipun, TF1 nandatangani kontrak kaliyan &lt;a href="Endemol"&gt;Endemol&lt;/a&gt; kanggé nyiarkan program sajinis punika. Endemol minangka parusahan ingkang sami ingkang damel Loft Story kanggé M6.
M6 inggih punika salah satunggaling saluran televisi ing Perancis ingkang gadhah program fiksi ilmiah minangka péranganing jadwal regulèeripun. &lt;a href="Drama"&gt;Drama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="supernatural"&gt;supernatural&lt;/a&gt; dipunsiaraken ing Setu wengi ingkang dipunsebut M6 minangka "la trilogie du samedi".
