<doc id="99394" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=99394" title="Kelabat">
Kelabat

Klabet utawi Fenugreek (; Trigonella foenum-graecum) kalebet tuwuhan saking kulawarga &lt;a href="Fabaceae"&gt;Fabaceae&lt;/a&gt;. Klabet saged dipun-ginakaken kanggé obat herbal &lt;a href="herb"&gt;herb&lt;/a&gt; (godhongipun) lan dados rempah (wijinipun). Klabet ugi kondhang minangka methi). Tuwuhan punika dipunbudi dayakaken kanthi global minangka semi-arid crop lan kalebet bumbu umum kanggé damel &lt;a href="kari"&gt;kari&lt;/a&gt; utawi &lt;a href="kar%C3%A9"&gt;karé&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Nama &lt;a href="wikt%3Afenugreek"&gt;fenugreek&lt;/a&gt; utawi foenum-graecum asalipun saking Basa &lt;a href="Latin%20language"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt; kanggé "Greek hay". Tuwuhan punika mirib kaliyan wild clover ingkang dipunsebat deéning tiyang &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt; minangka: "bockhornsklöver" sami kaliyan namanipun wonten ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Jerman"&gt;Basa Jerman&lt;/a&gt; ingkang ateges: "ram's horn clover". Zohary lan Hopf nyathet bilih boten saged dipuntemtokaken pundi ingkang tipe alamiah saking strain Trigonella ingkang lajeng dipundomestikasi dados fenugreek nanging dipunpitadosi bilih tuwuhan punika rumiyin dipunbudidayakaken ing &lt;a href="Near%20East"&gt;Near East&lt;/a&gt;. Turahan klabet kapanggih wonten ing Tell Halal, &lt;a href="Iraq"&gt;Iraq&lt;/a&gt;, (dhedhasar alisa &lt;a href="radiocarbon"&gt;radiocarbon&lt;/a&gt; prakiraan umur dumugi 4000 BC) lan &lt;a href="Jaman%20Perunggu"&gt;Jaman Perunggu&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Lachish"&gt;Lachish&lt;/a&gt;. Ingkang wiji garingipun kapanggih wonten ing makam &lt;a href="Tutankhamen"&gt;Tutankhamen&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Cato%20the%20Elder"&gt;Cato the Elder&lt;/a&gt; lists fenugreek with &lt;a href="clover"&gt;clover&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="vetch"&gt;vetch&lt;/a&gt; as crops grown to feed cattle (&lt;a href="De%20Agri%20Cultura"&gt;De Agri Cultura&lt;/a&gt;, 27).
<h2>Produksi</h2>
Produksi.
Produksi utami klabet inggih punika &lt;a href="Nepal"&gt;Nepal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bangladesh"&gt;Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Egypt"&gt;Egypt&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="France"&gt;France&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Spain"&gt;Spain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Turkey"&gt;Turkey&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Morocco"&gt;Morocco&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Cina"&gt;Cina&lt;/a&gt;. India punika nagara ingkang ngasilaken klabet paling ageng ing donya ing kawasan &lt;a href="Rajasthan"&gt;Rajasthan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gujarat"&gt;Gujarat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Uttaranchal"&gt;Uttaranchal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Uttar%20Pradesh"&gt;Uttar Pradesh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Madhya%20Pradesh"&gt;Madhya Pradesh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maharashtra"&gt;Maharashtra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Haryana"&gt;Haryana&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Punjab%20%28India%29"&gt;Punjab&lt;/a&gt; punika sentra produksi paling ageng ing India. Kalebet 80% produksi total nagaranipun. Qasoori Methi langkung kondhang kanggé aroma pembangkit selera, asalipun saking Qasur, &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dipunilini toya saking Kali Sutlej, ing India lan Pakistan ing kawasan &lt;a href="Punjab%20region"&gt;Punjab&lt;/a&gt;. (sources: T. Jilani PhD, Arizona, DASD 2007)
<h2>Mupangat</h2>
<h3>Bumbu Masakan</h3>
Mupangat.
Bumbu Masakan.
Wiji ingkang awujud kubus kanthi warna kuning dumugi amber asring dipun-ginakaken kanggé damel &lt;a href="Indian%20pickle"&gt;pickles&lt;/a&gt;, serbuk kari lan pasta kari, ugi klabet asring dipungayutaken kaliyan masakan saking India. Godhong garing ingkang dipunwastani kasuri methi (utawi kasoori methi ing &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;), bibar wewengkon &lt;a href="Kasur"&gt;Kasur&lt;/a&gt; ing Provinsi &lt;a href="Punjab%2C%20Pakistan"&gt;Punjab, Pakistan&lt;/a&gt; papan tuwuhan punika dipuntandur kanthi ageng gadhah rasa pait lan aroma ingkang nyengat sanget. Nalika dipunpanèn minangka wiji ijo dipunsebat &lt;a href="Samodra%20Methi"&gt;Samodra Methi&lt;/a&gt;, ing &lt;a href="Maharashtra"&gt;Maharashtra&lt;/a&gt; mliginipun ing kiwa-tengené &lt;a href="Mumbai"&gt;Mumbai&lt;/a&gt; ingkang asring dipuntandur celak pasisir ingkang mawi pasir. Awit saking punika lajeng dipunsebat &lt;a href="Samodra"&gt;Samodra&lt;/a&gt; ingkang ateges sagara ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Sanskerta"&gt;Basa Sanskerta&lt;/a&gt;. Klabet ugi dipun-ginakaken déning bangsa Eritrea lan Etiopia minangka bumbu masakan. Tembung klabet ing Basa &lt;a href="Amharic%20language"&gt;Amharic&lt;/a&gt; punika abesh (utawi abish) lan wiji dipun-ginakaken ing Etiopia minangka pangobatan &lt;a href="diab%C3%A8tes"&gt;diabètes&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Laktasi utawi ASI</h3>
Laktasi utawi ASI.
Wiji klabet dipunpitadosi saged ningkataken produksi ASI.
Saking kasiling panaliten kapanggih bilih klabet punika kalebet stimulator potent kanggé produksi ASI ingkang prakiraan saged ningkataken ASI 900%.
<h3>Obat</h3>
Obat.
Laporan uji non klinis nedahaken bilih klabet saged dados antivirus amargi saged nambani demam biyasa ing kelompok relawan.
